    "raw": "Never have I felt so alone. I am surrounded by my Glitch kin, and yet I know deep down I am an outcast. At night, I sleep, and I dream. Dream! Glitch do not dream. I dream of escape, of journeying beyond the stars, of carving a life out for myself, away from this drudgery.",
    "value": "我从未感到如此孤独。身边尽是电子人族亲，可我心底深知，自己已是个异类。夜晚，我入睡，我会做梦。做梦！电子人从不会做梦。我梦见逃离，梦见远航星海之外，梦见为自己开辟新生，远离这苦役般的存在。"
