    "raw": "My thought process is changing. It terrifies me. I have desires, now. I question things. I almost caught myself second-guessing a directive out loud. I can feel my connection to the central consciousness fading, and while this scares me, there is a feeling of comfort there too.",
    "value": "我的思维进程正在蜕变。这令我惊惧。如今，我有了欲望。我开始质疑周遭。我几乎要脱口而出，质疑一道指令。我能感觉到自己与那中枢意识的联结正逐渐淡去，尽管这让我害怕，但其中，竟也夹杂着一丝慰藉。"
